# The repository root ignores `.vscode/`, which is source here: the launch
# configuration is how you run this extension. A pattern in a nested ignore
# file wins over the root's, so it is re-included deliberately rather than by
# accident. Dependencies lock through the root `bun.lock`; there is no lockfile
# in this directory.
!.vscode/

node_modules/
out/
dist/
*.vsix
.vscode-test/
